    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henahana Yoshuwa watambikili niaRubeni, niaGadi, nimuchidi waManase wachibalu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wayilili nindi, Enu munahembi mwejima mwayilejeliyi kambuŋa Yehova Mosi, munatiyi nimwizu dami mwejima munayilejeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mafuku anavuli dehi anashiki nikwifuku dalelu ana kwenu himunayilekeli kanka wawuku, munahembi lushiiku lwaYehova Nzambi yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu Yehova Nzambi yenu nayimweneshi ana kwenu mwomuna mwahosheliyi nawu; dichi dinu funtenu kwenu mudiyili kwenu kumatenti enu, kwituŋa denu dimunaheti, dayinkeliyi kambuŋa Yehova Mosi mwishinadi daYodana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiŋa mwakashaŋa muchima nankashi wakwila nikuleja ninshimbi jayilejeliyi kambuŋa Yehova Mosi, mwakamukeŋi Yehova Nzambi yenu, mwakendi munjila jindi jejima, mwakahembi kuleja kwindi, mwakamulamati mbe, mwakamukalakeli namuchima wenu wejima, nawumi wenu wejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa wayikiswilili nkisu, wayilili nindi, Yenuŋa kwenu. Ayili kwawu kumatenti awu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chibalu chamuchidi waManase chimu, Mosi wayinkeli wuswana wawu muBashani, hakwila chibalu chikwawu Yoshuwa wayinkeli wuswana wawu mukachi kawana kwawu mwishinadi daYodana kumujika. Dichi chayililiyi Yoshuwa, nindi yenu kwenu kumatenti enu, wayikiswilili nkisu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wayilili nindi, Funtenu kwenu kumatenti enu namaheta amavulu, nayimuna yayivulu, nasiliva, niwuru, niwunegu, niyikugu, nimahina amavulu nankashi; yuma yimunapupi kudi ayilumbu jenu kunjita mwakapaŋiluku ana kwenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nianyana kaRubeni, nianyana kaGadi, nimuchidi waManase wachibalu afuntili cheŋi, afumini kwadiguwu anyana kaIsarela kuShilo, wekala mwituŋa daKenani, ayi kwituŋa daGileyadi, kwituŋa dawu dakudihetela, daheteluwu mwomwayilejeliyi Yehova kukanwa kaMosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chashikiluwu kumpata yakundama kuYodana, yamwituŋa daKenani, anyana kaRubeni, nianyana kaGadi, nimuchidi waManase wachibalu, atuŋili kameŋa kwakwihi naYodana, kukatala kameŋa kana keneni kwaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaIsarela atiyili nawu, Anyana kaRubeni, nianyana kaGadi, nimuchidi waManase wachibalu anatuŋi dehi kameŋa kuna kuwidikilu wetuŋa daKenani, mumpata yakundama kuYodana, ishinadi dambala dawanyana kaIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chachitiyiluwu anyana kaIsarela, chipompelu chejima chadipompesheli kuShilo nawu tuyi twakadasi nawu njita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaIsarela amutemesheli Fwinehasi mwana kakapristu Eleyazari kudi anyana kaRubeni, nikudi anyana kaGadi, nikumuchidi waManase wachibalu, mwituŋa daGileyadi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atemesheli hamu nayena atulamba ikumi, hevumu kalamba, hevumu kalamba, mwahita nyichidi yawaIsarela yejima; wejima wawu adiŋi iwu mukulumpi wevumu, iwu mukulumpi wevumu, hadiŋi makombakaji awaIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashikili kwituŋa daGileyadi kudi anyana kaRubeni, nikudi anyana kaGadi, nikumuchidi waManase wachibalu, ahosheli nawena, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawu, Tiyenu chinahoshi chipompelu chaYehova chejima, nawu, Indi muloŋa munamukoŋi Nzambi yaIsarela himuloŋanyi mwaka mufuntumu lelu kubula kumulondela Yehova, mwaka namutuŋi kameŋa kenu, kulonda mudikaŋi lelu naYehova? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indi kuluwa kutwaluwili kuPeyori, kwenoku kuluwa nilelu tuchidi kanda tuditookeshi mwokuku, kutoŋa o chipúpu chenjili muchipompelu chaYehova, kunakehi dehi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwaka mufuntumu kubula kumulondela lelu Yehova? Chimukwila lelu himudikaŋi naYehova, kumadiki keŋa azuwi nachipompelu chaIsarela chejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa neyi ituŋa dimunaheti hidajilaku, komana zambukenu kwenu mwinzi mwituŋa danahetiyi Yehova, mwashakama tabanaka yaYehova, muheteli hamu nanetu. Bayi mudikaŋa naYehova, hela nanetu, nakutuŋa kameŋa kenu kakubombela kukameŋa kaYehova Nzambi yetuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indi mwana kaZera Akani haputili muloŋa wachuma chajilaku? Nindombu hiyaholokeleli chipompelu chaIsarela chejimaku? Yenowu iyala haluwiliyi ochu wajilumukilumu kanka windi wanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaRubeni, nianyana kaGadi, nimuchidi waManase wachibalu ayakwili, ayilili awakulumpi jamakombakaji awaIsarela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawu, Yehova Nzambi yawanzambi, Yehova Nzambi yawanzambi, diyi weluka, niaIsarela niwena akeluka neyi tuneli chakudikaŋa, indi kwiji neyi chakuputa muloŋa naYehova nakutuŋa kameŋa ketu kakufuntamu nachu kubula kumulondela Yehova, komana neyi ochu bayi namutuhandisha leluku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hela neyi tunalondi kulambwila nyilambu yakushita, hela nyilambu yawuŋa, hela neyi tunalondi kuketwilahu yimuna yanyilambu yakuwunda, yomweni Yehova ataluku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bayi chitunakoŋichi tunalondi kubabalaku? Hitwakwata maanaku? Kumwaka anyanenu akamba kayila anyanetu nawu, Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela wenu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamba kahosha nawu, Muloŋa Yehova nashi dehi Yodana ekali ŋinza mukachi ketu nanenu, enu anyana kaRubeni, ninenu anyana kaGadi; akenda kahosha nawu, Enu himukweti iseka kudi Yehovaku; dichi anyanenu akalekesha anyanetu kumwakama Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dihu hanafumi kwila netu, Tutuŋi kameŋa ketu, hikanyilambu yakushita, hela kayimuna yakumuketwila Nzambuku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilaŋa kakeli chinsahu mukachi ketu nanenu, nimukachi kawanyanetu amba kahiŋamu, kulonda twakamukogeli Yehova mudimu windi kumesu indi, nanyilambu yetu yakushita, nayimuna yetu yakumuketwila Nzambi, ninyilambu yetu yakuwunda; anyanenu akenda kahosha anyanetu kumwaka nawu, Enu himukweti iseka kudi Yehovaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi twelili netu, Chamba katuhoshawu etu, hela anyanetu mwenomu, etu netu twamba kayila netu, Talenu mwatuŋililuwu ankakulula jetu kameŋa kaYehova, hikanyilambu yakushita, hela kayimuna yakuketulaku; kawunsahu wamukachi ketu nanenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etu tudikaŋi naYehova? Indi tufuntumu lelu kubula kumulondela Yehova? Mwaka tutuŋi kameŋa hela kanyilambu yakushita, hela kanyilambu yawuŋa, hela kayimuna yakuketulaku, kulonda tubombeli kukameŋa kaYehova Nzambi yetu kekala kumesu atabanaka yindi? Chinjila!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
